{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f46b0ab9aaef4f1698c02f3202c4790bea1e20602115ac61f179a48da7e4a3d1","ja":"そ、そりゃ、英語が話せた方がいいんだろうけどさ、\nやっぱオレにはムリだよ……。","zh":"话、话是这么说，能说英语肯定更好就是了，\n但对我来说果然还是不行啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"be8b5326d901e85df7f41412d4d2168b4f8845cfeb528f0e344407e74023d8d9","ja":"学校で習ってるでしょ。\n全然話せない、なんてことはないんじゃないの？","zh":"学校里不是有教过吗？\n总不至于完全说不出来吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"66d98ee998bcbe42c2c88d4f57cc8db877a8dd168346c38dbba625a91c04b525","ja":"なんとなくはわかるかもしれないけど、\nとっさに話すのは難しそうね……。","zh":"可能大概能听懂，\n但要马上开口说似乎会很难呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5a278f73ffe57abbc91d2b8313cd4fe2f5d8c3f11d239252ec8dfbacb82c7cf6","ja":"普段、使ってないからよ。難しい単語を\n使わなくても、意思の疎通くらいはできるんだから。","zh":"平时都没怎么用过呢。\n就算不用难懂的词，基本的心意还是能相通的嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c070a9c52eda58186246b9debf6e3d8135c8bfb406ae728a7599c26e66d49e32","ja":"そういうもんなのか？","zh":"是这样的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"21c64c77b7408c0574567bfcf422b0f67d91b18bccd7923286cae195ee8b92d2","ja":"そういうものよ！\n知ってる単語くらいあるでしょ？","zh":"就是这样的啦！\n总有你认识的单词吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"486b5229384355518ea667576d47f5a73a6960699f542cf83a738fd1c7caecf4","ja":"知ってる単語って……えーっと、\nファールボールとか、セーフティーバントとか……。","zh":"知道的词汇吗……呃，\n界外球啦，安全触击球啦……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7ac3a479223259582f3bab7a457bb6c80103a4d5775b78d3c90db0d87a898e61","ja":"わ、私は、ワインとかウイスキーとか……\nあ、カクテルの名前くらいだったら……！","zh":"我、我平时会喝红酒或者威士忌什么的……\n啊，要是鸡尾酒的名字的话，我倒还知道一些……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"db04f9e0277cc557c3b33130dcd46197c14eb3a90522a46a47876f64356899cb","ja":"どうして、野球とお酒ばっかりなのよ！","zh":"为什么总是只有棒球和酒啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3679fc2623d7e406c88d4d979df099490612a2e30b863c53564cbcb5c23a83b9","ja":"とにかく、間違ってもいいから、\n機会があったら話してみること！　いい？","zh":"总之，就算说错也没关系，\n有机会就试着开口说！好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"af932bab7369d5aaacdf3d3f03fe14398759a5d39711ced4b064ae07b11d7ce8","ja":"伊織ちゃん、スパルタね。でもたしかに\nそれくらいしないと身につかないのかも……。","zh":"伊织还真是斯巴达呢。不过确实，\n不做到那种程度的话，也许就掌握不了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c8ab24f9bb8bff39311af7c31e966b92be5dc1da82b27e4845afc995e8350c11","ja":"「ハロー！」","zh":"「Hello！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ca745068198a1c633562b0ac3b2f993f22d7957aff07160e5355f770d03faed8","ja":"あら、早速チャンスが来たわ。\nダンスバトルの効果は絶大ね♪","zh":"哎呀，机会这么快就来了。\n街舞对决的效果真是出类拔萃呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"76ffadc9c8d3fbc6a76647986f19595ec7dc375af3d9d06db3f7cc9b27c1ed0a","ja":"向こうもふたり連れだし、ふたりで話してみなさい。\n大丈夫！　ちゃんと話せば気持ちは伝わるわよ♪","zh":"对方也是两个人，你们两个去跟他们聊聊看吧。\n没事的！只要好好沟通，心意一定能传达到的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1291.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e5f91bb650280b2b30ce6ce0679f75e90aa525784267d17b327ec12f941c0d1d","ja":"ええーっ！？　いきなりかよ！","zh":"咦——！？太突然了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
